{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0JvbGx5d29vZC8xOTkxLS0yMDAwL0R1bGhlJTIwUmFqYSUyMCUyODE5OTglMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Dulhe Raja","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2sr6IDYP0ex53UEmLXA4garBt0o.jpg","description":"Poor Raja opens a fast foot restaurant right opposite a five star hotel run by its owner Singhania, earning his wrath. The wealthy hotel owner uses all his influence to remove Raja, but in vain. Things get worse for the wealthy man, when his daughter Kiran wants to marry the poor hotelier. The wealthy man refuses, leading to a confrontation and a condition - which Raja fulfills, he becomes rich virtually overnight, and proposes for the hand of Kiran. The wealthy hotelier reluctantly accepts him as his son-in-law, only to have Kiran elope with a man named Rahul.","releaseInfo":"1998","genres":["Comedy","Romance","Bollywood"],"imdbRating":"6.2","runtime":"155 min","cast":["Govinda","Raveena Tandon","Kader Khan","Prem Chopra","Mohnish Behl","Johny Lever","Asrani","Anjana Mumtaz"],"director":["Harmesh Malhotra"],"released":"1998-07-10T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Govinda","character":"Raja","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jIY8akWgvhgbIgZDd20yIPFDSv8.jpg"},{"name":"Raveena Tandon","character":"Kiran Singhania","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4z0X9ZMgyNZRHfJG4G2Z10rhLpu.jpg"},{"name":"Kader Khan","character":"K.K. Singhania","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gf0v2N4xKNGDfHN5lxk7yxUEYQ3.jpg"},{"name":"Prem Chopra","character":"Bishambar Nath","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4hLAhScWZA6utfg8VCivwVH6FHy.jpg"},{"name":"Mohnish Behl","character":"Rahul Sinha","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iiDceTPiwHY4y91gdP3OsEHOo7r.jpg"},{"name":"Johny Lever","character":"Bankey","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/kohAOhKr4HBln8b9P4i1kmMONyi.jpg"},{"name":"Asrani","character":"Azghar Singh","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zoZRnIHNkCRq4gKZGaQhbtPrIDj.jpg"},{"name":"